<section class="section"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Our history</span><h2>Past DSgG Events</h2>
<p>From its beginnings as a workshop series to an increasingly self-organised community, <em>Data Stewardship goes Germany</em> has brought people together for exchange and collaboration.</p>
<div class="card-grid">
<article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">28–29 September 2026 · Cologne</span><h3>DSgG 2026</h3><p><em>From going to growing.</em> The fifth meeting focused on community collaboration, professionalisation, and strategic development.</p><a href="https://fdm.uni-koeln.de/dsgg26">Event website →</a></article>
<article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">30 September–1 October 2025 · Karlsruhe</span><h3>DSgG 2025</h3><p><em>Data Stewardship in Everyday Research.</em> The fourth workshop explored practical experiences, tools, interoperability, and reproducibility.</p><a href="https://www.rdm.kit.edu/english/train-edu_workshops_dsgg.php">Event website →</a></article>
<article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">11–12 September 2024 · Aachen</span><h3>DSgG 2024</h3><p>The third workshop emphasised networking, community building, and opportunities for sustained collaboration.</p><a href="https://blog.rwth-aachen.de/forschungsdaten/tag/data-stewardship-goes-germany/">Event reports and information →</a></article>
<article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">25–26 September 2023 · Dresden</span><h3>DSgG 2023</h3><p>The second workshop brought together data stewardship professionals to exchange experiences and discuss professional roles and research data practices.</p><a href="https://www.slub-dresden.de/en/visit/trainings-and-events/events/fachtagung-konferenz/data-stewardship-goes-germany">Event information →</a></article>
<article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">13–14 October 2022 · Braunschweig</span><h3>DSgG 2022</h3><p>The first Data Stewardship goes Germany workshop established a national meeting point for sharing experiences, challenges, and good practices.</p><a href="https://www.uni-bremen.de/en/data-science-center/news-events/news-article/data-stewardship-goes-germany">Event information →</a></article>
</div></div></section>
